# Template for the uncommitted .env the package's `deploy` script consumes
# (every deploy UPSERTS the .env values into the service env —
# removing a key here does NOT remove it from the service; that takes a
# Variables DELETE against the Serverless API).
# Release CI runs it with these values from GitHub secrets; locally, the
# credentials the script reads come from Doppler:
#   doppler run -p <project> -c <config> -- pnpm --filter @usecontextlayer/twilio run deploy
# Replace the placeholders with the Twilio config; verify the workplace with `doppler me`.
# CTX_FOUNDER_CELL: the founder's personal cell in E.164 — the number the gate
# dials. Use the same resource name across consumers; the caller ID the
# founder's phone shows is hardcoded in
# functions/founder-call.protected.js (public infrastructure constant, not config).
CTX_FOUNDER_CELL=+15005550006
